      "id": "claim_b7c1293522f5449898fc2d917f946d62",
      "statement": "gen-secrets.sh is idempotent and non-destructive: write() keeps any existing file (printing keep vs created) and umask 077 protects new ones, so re-running to add a service or plugin never rotates existing credentials.",
