    {
      "id": "claim_19eb9a7487b242ff8ee15bdb3db3e64d",
      "statement": "svc_tokens_verify.json is regenerated on every run: gen-secrets.sh hashes each service token with sha256 and writes a map where services appear under their own name and plugins under plugin:<id>, which every service mounts at /run/secrets/svc_tokens_verify to verify incoming callers.",
