    {
      "id": "claim_2a2784e507b34212bf74584368813d93",
      "statement": "LLM keys are generated as a unit on first run: gateway.env (OPENAI_API_KEY and OPENROUTER_API_KEY left empty for the operator, BIFROST_ENCRYPTION_KEY, a policy-compliant BIFROST_ADMIN_PASSWORD mirrored into gateway_admin_password, VK_ORCHESTRATOR, VK_EXPERIMENTS, and per component in LLM_COMPONENTS a cloud VK plus a _local VK) is created together with the per-agent llm_key_* secret files carrying the same values; only the llm-gateway container reads gateway.env, so provider keys never enter agent containers.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://deploy/docker-compose.yml#L76-L77",
